# Copy to `.dev.vars` for `wrangler dev`. Never commit `.dev.vars`.

# Preferred: the PEM public key from Clerk Dashboard -> API keys -> "Show JWT public key".
# Enables networkless token verification (no JWKS fetch per cold start).
CLERK_JWT_KEY="-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----\n...\n-----END PUBLIC KEY-----"

# Fallback if CLERK_JWT_KEY is not set: the Clerk secret key (sk_test_... / sk_live_...).
# CLERK_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...

# DeepInfra API token (https://deepinfra.com/dash/api_keys).
DEEPINFRA_API_KEY=...

# Optional overrides for local development.
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000
